page_content="<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## Schedule for Grand Finale of Smart India Hackathon 2025-Software Edition (8th -gth December 2025)\n\n7th December 2025\n\nThe registration process for participant teams andmentors is to be MANDATORY completed by the evening/nightof 7th December 2025\n\n7.00AM to7.30 AM 7:45AM\n\nBreakfast\n\n8th December 2025:Day1\n\nAssemble at venue\n\n## Local lnauguration at Nodal Center\n\nAfter the local inauguration, the Nodal Centers will connect to the central inauguration\n\n8:00AMto8:05AM\n\nInauguration of Grand Finale of Smart India Hackathon 202s'at therespective nodal centers\n\n8:05AMto8:15AM\n\nLamp Lighting at the Venue\n\n8:15AM to8:20 AM\n\nWelcome Address by Chairman/President of the institute\n\n8:20 AMto8:30AM\n\nFelicitation of Dignitaries\n\n8:30AM to8:35AM\n\nSpeech by Guest of Honor\n\n8:35AMto8:40AM\n\nSpeech by Chief Guest at Venue\n\n8:45AM\n\nLocal Inauguration Ends\n\n9:00AMto9:30AM\n\n## Central Inauguration\n\n## Inauguration Ends\n\n## 8th December 2025:Day1\n\n11:00PM\n\n9:30AM\n\nCoding Begins\n\n10:30AM to 11:30AM\n\nTea AndSnacks on Table\n\nFirst Round of Mentoring Session.(7-10 minutes per team,Individual Ministry/organization expert to train the teams,3minimum judges per panel)\n\n11:30AM to01:00 PM\n\n01:00 PM to02:00 PM\n\n## Lunch\n\n4:30 PM to5:00 PM\n\nTea and snacks\n\nFirst Round of Evaluation(minimum three judges per panel,7minutes per team,4minutes presenting,3minsQand A)\n\n7:00PM-8:30 PM\n\n8:30PM-9:00PM 9:00PM\n\n## Dinner\n\nCoding Resumes\n\nMidnight Energy drink(Energy drink,juice or the like to be provided to each individual memberofthe team)\n\n## 9th December 2025: Overnight Phase (Day 2)\n\nOrganizing Partners\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nTechnology Partner\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nKnowledge Partners\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nMedio Partners\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n00:00AM-00:30AM 01:00AM-02:00AM 02:00AM 03:00AM\n\n6:00AM-6:15AM\n\n6:30AM-7:30AM\n\n9:00 AM-10:00 AM\n\n10:00AM\n\n12:00 PM-12:45PM\n\n12:45PM-1:30PM 01:30PM 4:00PM-4:30PM\n\n05.30PM\n\n05.30PM-7:00PM\n\n7:00PM-7.30PM\n\n8:00 PM to 8:30 PM\n\n8:45PM\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nSecond Round of Mentoring(5 to 7mins per team)\n\nSnacks and biscuits served on Table\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nRecreational Activity/ Cultural Programme (Karaoke/Singing/ Dance/ Zumba) Coding Continues\n\n## 9th December 2025:Day2\n\nYoga Session\n\nBreakfast served\n\nSecond Round of Evaluatlon (minimum3 Judges Per Panel,evaluating implementation of ideas)\n\nTea andSnacksServed at Table\n\nFinal round of Mentoring(Last and final Round of mentoring by Ministry/organization professionals)\n\nLunch\n\nCoding Continues\n\nTea andSnacksServed at Table\n\nCoding Stops\n\nFinal Round of Evaluation(minimum 3Judges Per Panel,evaluating implementation of ideas)\n\n## Result Finalization by Judges in a separate hall at the venue.Judges to internally discuss and shortlist teams\n\nValedictory Session and Prize distribution ceremony\n\nDinner to be provided.Students will leave thePremises and head for the dormitories/hostels.\n\nNote:lf certain teams areheadingback to their hometowns on the same evening,the Institute need tobe provided transportation to the railway/bus station\n\n## 10th December 2025 Post-Hackathon Departures\n\nTea/ Coffee and Brunch to be provided.The departure of teams to their respective hometowns by early afternoon teams need to beprovidedwith transportation torailway/ bus station.\n\n1112\n\nCRIFOUNDATION\n\nMedia Partners\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nKnowledge Partners\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->"

